  "remarks": "Designation: a) Colonel ; b) Commander of FDLR-FOCA (CDe.005)\nPassport no: na National identification no: na. Gender: Male. As one of the main Democratic Forces for the Liberation of Rwanda Forces Combattantes Abacunguzi (FDLR-FOCA) (CDe.005) commanders and the new commander of the Commando de Recherche et d'Action en Profondeur (CRAP), GUSTAVE KUBWAYO alias SIRKOOF is involved in planning, promulgating and supporting the armed group’s activities, such as targeting civilians, kidnapping for ransom and illegally exploiting natural resources.; Listing: Listed by 1533 Committee on 14 July 2026",
